liance interiors, detailed trim work or other extras. They are not automatically part of a standard clean.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section wrap prose"><h2>What to tell us before we quote.</h2><p>Bedroom and bathroom counts, approximate size, pets, parking and when the home was last professionally cleaned all help us understand the job. A smaller home with significant buildup can need more work than a larger maintained one.</p><h3>Agree the boundaries.</h3><p>Heavy lifting, hazardous materials, pest contamination, specialist remediation and work at height are not assumed to be included. Let us know about anything unusual so we can discuss suitability before a visit.</p><p>Supplies, product preferences and any access arrangements should be agreed before confirmation. Keep door and alarm codes out of your booking request. We&#8217;ll arrange access with you before your visit.</p><p>Moving to a new address? See <a href="/move-out-cleaning/">move-out cleaning in Calgary</a> for empty-home preparation, appliance interiors and handover planning.</p><a href="/pricing/">How quotes are built</a></section><section class="section wrap prose"><h2>Apartment and condo cleaning in Calgary.</h2><p>Share the rooms to clean, your building&#8217;s entry arrangements and any parking or lift booking requirements so we can plan access.</p><h3>Need more than a regular clean?</h3><p>See our <a href="/book/?service=deep">deep cleaning in Calgary</a> service.</p><h3>Looking for house cleaners near you?</h3><p>We clean homes in Calgary. Add your neighbourhood or postal code to your request so we can confirm your visit.</p><p>For an empty home before key handover, see our <a href="/move-out-cleaning/">Calgary move-out cleaning checklist</a>. For an occupied home, <a href="/book/?service=regular">book your clean</a>.</p></section><section class="section wrap" id="reviews"><p class="eyebrow">Calgary clients</p><h2>Homes we&#8217;ve cleaned.<br><em>In their words.</em></